# Complex Document for Benchmarking

This document contains a wide variety of djot features to stress-test the parser.

## Typography and Inline Elements

This paragraph has *strong emphasis* and _regular emphasis_ mixed together.
Here's some `inline code` and a [link with title](https://example.com "Example Title").
We also have {+inserted text+} and {-deleted text-} for editing marks.
The {=highlighted text=} stands out, and we have H{~2~}O for subscript.
Math formula: $E = mc^2$ is famous. And x{^2^} for superscript.

## Smart Typography

"Double quoted text" and 'single quoted text' should be converted.
An ellipsis... and em-dash---here and en-dash--there.

