## Code Blocks with Languages

```python
def fibonacci(n):
    """Calculate the nth Fibonacci number."""
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)

class Calculator:
    def __init__(self):
        self.result = 0

    def add(self, value):
        self.result += value
        return self
```

```javascript
class EventEmitter {
    constructor() {
        this.events = {};
    }

    on(event, callback) {
        if (!this.events[event]) {
            this.events[event] = [];
        }
        this.events[event].push(callback);
    }

    emit(event, ...args) {
        if (this.events[event]) {
            this.events[event].forEach(cb => cb(...args));
        }
    }
}
```

```rust
fn main() {
    let numbers: Vec<i32> = (1..=10).collect();
    let sum: i32 = numbers.iter().sum();
    println!("Sum: {}", sum);
}
```

